From 02ea8a53233ac724df4341546a6af10f9e7435f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 23:46:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add run-completion tracking so the buyer portal notifies when
 the agent ends
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

buyer_workflow_runs (new table + save-buyer-workflow-run function) is a
durable, server-side record of each triggered run and its status, created
at trigger time and backfilled with buyer_id once the client resolves it.
useAgentStatus now surfaces a distinct "completed" state once a run's
status flips (driven by the scheduled Yoxa-sync task), rendered as a
pill state change plus a dashboard banner linking to /buyer/solution —
previously nothing distinguished a finished run from a still-working one.
